BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Creatives at the Table: Getting Involved in Local and State Govern
 ment
DTSTART:20261116T150000
DTEND:20261116T170000
DTSTAMP:20261116T210633Z
UID:9c7c4370bd0e7990c0286a86c08bf2@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:How can artists and creatives help shape Vermont’s future th
 rough civic engagement? This panel workshop will bring together current an
 d former legislators with deep roots in the creative sector for a conversa
 tion about pathways to public service and the importance of having creativ
 es at the policymaking table. Participants will leave with a personal acti
 on plan for civic engagement\, be it running for office or service on loca
 l boards and commissions. This event will take place in Downtown Brattlebo
 ro\, a hub of arts and creativity\, and will be hosted at the new DBA Gara
 ge by the Downtown Brattleboro Alliance. Snow Date: 3-5 p.m.\, Wednesday\,
  Dec. 2\, 2026 Presenters - Emily Carris-Duncan\, Vermont State Representa
 tive\, Windham-6 - Zon Eastes\, Vermont State Representative\, Windham-1 -
  Robert McBride\, Founder\, The Rockingham Arts and Museum Project - Susan
  Evans McClure\, Executive Director\, Vermont Arts Council Accessibility: 
 We strive to host inclusive\, accessible events that enable all individual
 s to participate. We will make every effort to accommodate requests made b
 y Nov. 2\, 2026. We realize that schedules often come together at the last
  minute. If it is later than Nov. 2 and accommodation would be helpful\, p
 lease let us know and we will do our best to help you participate. Access 
 requests may be made through the registration form\, or may be addressed t
 o Michele Bailey\, Accessibility Coordinator at mbailey@vermontartscouncil
 .org or 802.402.4614. Voice and relay calls welcome. View the Know Before 
 You Go Guide for detailed information about parking\, terrain\, restrooms
 \, and more: https://www.vermontartscouncil.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10
 /Know-Before-You-Go-Creatives-at-the-Table.pdf\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Downtown Brattleboro Alliance Garage\, 22 High St.
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/creatives-
 at-the-table-getting-involved-in-local-and-state-government-08-10-2026-15-
 31-01
END:VEVENT
