UID:9b174e99446126e240c9624e7d33a0@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Robert Ludwig will present a program of music from the 17th to
  the 21st centuries for the pipe organ on the college’s 50-rank\, 3100 p
 ipe Gress-Miles instrument. The concert includes selections by Frescobaldi
 \, Samuel Barber\, J.S. Bach\, Franck and a celebratory arrangement the Af
 rican-American spiritual\, “Keep your hand on the plow\, hold on!”\n\n
 Sources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Middlebury College Chapel\, 75 Hepburn Rd
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/mid-day-or
 gan-concert-29-10-2026-15-42-21
